&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4400&quot; data-local-id=&quot;34f06896b1e0&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in at least one relevant area, such as model routing, recommender systems, agent systems, retrieval and memory, model evaluation, distributed systems, or protocol and API design&lt;/p&gt;
