&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9c021f89220b&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4724&quot; data-local-id=&quot;de20682526c6&quot;&gt;Experience designing, executing, and analyzing machine learning experiments with appropriate statistical rigor&lt;/p&gt;
