&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;65rta&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;aibue-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;aibue-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;aibue-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;aibue-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;As a senior engineer, you will lead technical work across this area. You&#39;ll partner with product, design, and engineering to turn hard, ambiguous problems into reliable, performant systems that ship to real security teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;65rta&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4njn2-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4njn2-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4njn2-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4njn2-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We&#39;re a distributed team — we work across time zones and collaborate in GitHub, Slack, design reviews, and code reviews.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
